    "image_with_text_wJrKp9": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "eyebrow_mBiXya": {
          "type": "eyebrow",
          "settings": {
            "text": "DESIGNED TO TELL A STORY"
          }
        },
        "heading_nQtJkU": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "The Dunrobin Story, Reflected in Every Bottle",
            "size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_4JUp8y": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Our connection to Dunrobin Castle, Golspie and the surrounding Sutherland landscape goes far beyond the botanicals used in our gin.</p><p>The very design of our bottles reflects the place and heritage behind Dunrobin Highland Distillery.</p><p>Working closely with internationally renowned Italian designer <a href=\"https://www.nichetto.com\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://www.nichetto.com\">Luca Nichetto</a>, we have carefully developed a distinctive visual identity that brings the Dunrobin story to life through thoughtful, contemporary design.</p><p>Each element of our distinctive pictogram represents a part of the landscape that inspires us.</p><p>The curved shape reflects the rolling hills of Sutherland that frame Dunrobin Castle and Golspie, where the fresh spring water used in our spirits is sourced.</p><p>The flowing line represents the beautiful East Sutherland coastline, stretching towards the horizon and reflecting the sea that has shaped this part of the Scottish Highlands for generations.</p><p>Our newly designed bottles place this pictogram at their heart, wrapping continuously around the glass and extending across our premium gift packaging.</p><p>Its scale and prominence reflect the grandeur and presence of Dunrobin Castle, while the continuous 360-degree design represents a story that never truly ends, paying tribute to the generations of history and heritage behind Dunrobin.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
