    "image_with_text_EKFn3f": {
      "type": "image-with-text",
      "blocks": {
        "eyebrow_nRCkbm": {
          "type": "eyebrow",
          "settings": {
            "text": "FROM DAIRY TO DISTILLERY"
          }
        },
        "heading_zEezCj": {
          "type": "heading",
          "settings": {
            "text": "Making Dunrobin Gin at Dunrobin Farm, Golspie",
            "size": "h2"
          }
        },
        "text_KfCbgG": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Dunrobin Gin is carefully distilled on Sutherland Estates, in the historic Old Dairy building at Dunrobin Farm, less than a mile from Dunrobin Castle in Golspie.</p><p>Once a working dairy, this building has been given a new lease of life as the home of Dunrobin Highland Distillery, continuing its history of local production in a new and exciting way.</p><p>From milk production to premium Scottish gin, the Old Dairy remains a place where the traditions of the estate meet the craftsmanship of today.</p><p>This is where Lizzie and Boban bring Dunrobin Gin to life, from the infusion of carefully selected botanicals through to bottling and the hand-applied wax seal that finishes every bottle.</p><p>Each stage is carried out with care and attention to detail, creating a Highland gin that reflects both the heritage of its home and the passion of the people behind it.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
