        "text_zJiA6k": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Whether you've visited Dunrobin Castle, explored the&nbsp;North Coast 500&nbsp;or simply share our love of the Scottish Highlands, Dunrobin Gin offers a way to enjoy a little taste of Sutherland wherever you are.</p><p>Our collection includes our signature Dunrobin Gin, available in 20cl and 70cl bottles, alongside premium gin gift sets and locally handmade chocolates created in collaboration with&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=100057594132068\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=100057594132068\">Highland Whisky Chocolates</a>&nbsp;in Golspie.</p><p>Explore our online shop&nbsp;to discover the full Dunrobin Highland Distillery collection, available for UK delivery.</p>"
          }
        },
