        "text_qHwcxy": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>If you're exploring Golspie, visiting Dunrobin Castle or travelling along the North Coast 500, you can also discover Dunrobin Gin in person at The Wee Gin Shop.</p><p>Situated within the grounds of Dunrobin Castle in Sutherland, The Wee Gin Shop is open seasonally during the Castle's visitor season, offering a welcoming place to enjoy a Dunrobin Gin and tonic, discover our Highland-inspired cocktails or pick up a bottle or gift to take home.</p><p><strong>Planning a visit?</strong>&nbsp;</p><p>Explore our&nbsp;<a href=\"/pages/visit\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"Visit\">Visit Us</a>&nbsp;page to find out more about The Wee Gin Shop, seasonal opening hours and how to find us at Dunrobin Castle, Golspie.</p>"
